00:34:19,208 --> 00:34:25,313
an arrow means a reference, plus and minus mean public and private. Each symbol

445
00:34:25,313 --> 00:34:26,621
records a decision.

446
00:34:27,121 --> 00:34:33,004
Three ways this goes wrong. One: classes named after database tables, like user row

447
