Two: missing the connection object. If borrower and due date are drifting onto Book,

449
00:34:44,198 --> 00:34:45,319
you've missed Loan.

450
00:34:45,819 --> 00:34:51,987
Three: listing every operation you can imagine. Step three is what an object provides

